    'Bigger, more detailed builds for ages 9 to 12, such as Star Wars vehicles, Friends towns and Ninjago dragons.' => '',
    'Detailed sets with longer build times and proper display models. They work for teens and adults alike.' => '',
    'LEGO sets for builders 18 and up: Icons, Architecture, Botanical Collection, Technic supercars and other display models.' => '',
    'Quick builds and pocket-money sets under 200 pieces. Good as small gifts, party favours or an impulse buy.' => '',
    'Big projects with thousands of pieces that take days to build: UCS Star Wars, Modular Buildings, Technic flagships and more.' => '',
    'Real-brick sets for primary-school kids that can be finished in one sitting.' => '',
    'Quick builds under 200 pieces, good for gifts, party favours and impulse buys.' => '',
