    'LEGO gifts for adults' => '',
    'Sets for film fans, gamers, plant lovers and big builds.' => '',
    'See our hand-picked LEGO gifts for adults.' => '',
    'LEGO gift ideas for adults - BrickAtlas' => '',
    'Hand-picked LEGO sets for adults, grouped by interest: films, plants, desk models, video games and big builds, with tips on choosing the right one.' => '',
    '{n, plural, =1{# set} other{# sets}} for adults who love films, games, plants or big projects. All of them are in the current LEGO range.' => '',
    'How to choose LEGO for an adult' => '',
    'Look at their passions, not the toy aisle.' => '',
    'Film fans, gamers and gardeners all have a LEGO set made for them.' => '',
    'Think about where it will stand.' => '',
    'Most 18+ sets are display models, so size and style matter as much as the theme.' => '',
    'It does not have to be expensive.' => '',
    'For 50–80 USD you get a set for an evening or two that looks great on a shelf.' => '',
    'A big set is time for yourself.' => '',
    'Over 3,000 pieces is a project for the whole holiday break or several weeks of evenings.' => '',
    'For the film fan' => '',
    'Scenes and vehicles from films people grew up with.' => '',
    'Wallace and Gromit\'s house with their famous inventions. A warm, funny model for anyone who loves British animation.' => '',
    'E.T. on the bike against the moon, the best-known scene from the film. A present with plenty of nostalgia.' => '',
    'The Batmobile from Tim Burton\'s "Batman Returns", with over 2,200 pieces. A big display model for a Batman fan.' => '',
    'Flowers that never wilt' => '',
    'Botanical sets look good in any home and never need watering.' => '',
    'A hanging pothos in a pot: a small, quick build that looks like the real plant. A safe pick when you are not sure what to buy.' => '',
    'A bouquet in dark, deep colours. A more elegant alternative to fresh flowers.' => '',
    'Woodland mushrooms with moss and small details. An unusual decoration for a shelf or desk.' => '',
    'For the desk' => '',
    'Small and medium models that fit on a desk or a shelf at work.' => '',
    'A Darth Vader bust with under 350 pieces. A Star Wars gadget for one evening and a modest budget.' => '',
    'The Hubble Space Telescope on a stand with a plaque. For someone into space and science.' => '',
    'The classic Jaguar E-Type in over 1,600 pieces. A present for a fan of old cars and good design.' => '',
    'Consoles and arcade machines for people who remember them from childhood.' => '',
    'The PlayStation console in LEGO, over 1,900 pieces. A strong pick for anyone who grew up with games.' => '',
    'A Donkey Kong arcade cabinet. Retro gaming in brick form that looks great in a gaming corner.' => '',
    'A big project for winter evenings' => '',
    'Thousands of pieces and weeks of building, for someone who likes to take their time.' => '',
    'London\'s Tower Bridge in 3,745 pieces. A large Architecture model that keeps a builder busy for many evenings.' => '',
    'Downton Abbey in 4,711 pieces, with characters from the series. A main present for a fan of period dramas.' => '',
    'Is LEGO a good gift for an adult?' => '',
    'Yes. LEGO has a whole 18+ range: display models, flowers and replicas of famous vehicles and buildings. Many adults build to relax.' => '',
    'How much should I spend on a LEGO set for an adult?' => '',
    'Sets for 50–150 USD make a good present. The biggest models cost more and work best as a main or joint gift.' => '',
    'What if I do not know which sets they already have?' => '',
    'Pick a release from the last few months, which they are less likely to own, or go for flowers, which few people collect in full.' => '',
    'The final battle from "Ocarina of Time" in brick form. The cheapest set in this section, and a scene every Zelda fan knows by heart.' => '',
    'Gustav Klimt\'s "The Kiss" in 4,000 pieces. A picture to hang on the wall, and building it feels like laying a mosaic.' => '',
    'More sets like these:' => '',
    'Available in your language' => 'Available in English',
    'BrickAtlas is also available in your language: prices, gift guides and the set finder.' => 'BrickAtlas is also available in English: prices, gift guides and the set finder.',
    'Switch' => '',
